# What a wish does inside an arena built by command (Moddy-Worlds#58), and what it did wrong in play on 2026-11-26.
# A strong creature wished in the prep room is held to the wish ladder at once; one wished outside every arena stands
# at its own numbers, and is held the moment its owner walks into an arena with it (jivinstev/ModdyTheWishWatch#174),
# and stands at its own numbers again once he walks out. A Builder creature made in the prep room goes to his hotbar
# as a wish and does not stand in the room (the prep room's hand-over, the same as in the arena world). Outside every
# arena a new Builder creature stands where he aimed, and is also put in his Wish Bag to make again (core #189).
# play-timeout: 600
@intent inside an arena built by command a strong wished creature is held to the ladder at once, one brought in from outside is held when its owner walks in and let go when he walks out, and a Builder creature made in the prep room is a hotbar wish
@world flat seed=11
@continue-on-fail

@step build the arena
@wait 3s
difficulty peaceful
gamemode survival
effect give @s minecraft:resistance 1500 4 true
effect give @s minecraft:saturation 1500 0 true
scoreboard objectives add arenatest dummy
moddy arena create pit confirm
@expect chat /Built the arena pit/ within 60s
@wait 2s

@step a strong wolf wished in the prep room is held to the ladder at once
wishsummon minecraft:wolf {"damage":100,"health":200,"name":"Probe In"}
@wait 10t
execute store result score #in arenatest run attribute @e[type=minecraft:wolf,name="Probe In",limit=1] minecraft:max_health get
@assert execute if score #in arenatest matches 1..40
kill @e[type=minecraft:wolf,name="Probe In"]

@step a strong wolf wished outside every arena stands at its own numbers
teleport @s ~400 ~ ~
@wait 2s
wishsummon minecraft:wolf {"damage":100,"health":200,"name":"Probe Out"}
@wait 10t
execute store result score #out arenatest run attribute @e[type=minecraft:wolf,name="Probe Out",limit=1] minecraft:max_health get
@assert execute if score #out arenatest matches 200

@step brought into the arena with him, it is held; taken out again, it is let go
teleport @s ~-400 ~ ~
teleport @e[type=minecraft:wolf,name="Probe Out"] @s
@wait 3s
execute store result score #brought arenatest run attribute @e[type=minecraft:wolf,name="Probe Out",limit=1] minecraft:max_health get
@assert execute if score #brought arenatest matches 1..40
teleport @s ~400 ~ ~
teleport @e[type=minecraft:wolf,name="Probe Out"] @s
@wait 3s
execute store result score #left arenatest run attribute @e[type=minecraft:wolf,name="Probe Out",limit=1] minecraft:max_health get
@assert execute if score #left arenatest matches 200
kill @e[type=minecraft:wolf,name="Probe Out"]
teleport @s ~-400 ~ ~
@wait 2s

@step a Builder creature made in the prep room is a hotbar wish, and does not stand in the room
moddy builder
@expect screen Wish Builder within 10s
@wait 1s
@click item "A creature"
@expect screen Pick a body within 5s
@wait 1s
@click slot 0
@expect screen Parts within 10s
@wait 10t
@click slot 49
@expect screen Powers within 10s
@wait 10t
@click slot 31
@expect screen Special moves within 10s
@wait 10t
@click slot 22
@expect screen /tune your/ within 5s
@click button "Make it!"
@expect chat /is on your hotbar/ within 120s
@wait 2s
@assert execute unless entity @e[tag=wishmob]

@step outside every arena, a new Builder creature stands where he aimed, and is in his Wish Bag too (core #189)
teleport @s ~400 ~ ~
@wait 2s
moddy builder
@expect screen Wish Builder within 10s
@wait 1s
@click item "A creature"
@expect screen Pick a body within 5s
@wait 1s
@click slot 0
@expect screen Parts within 10s
@wait 10t
@click slot 49
@expect screen Powers within 10s
@wait 10t
@click slot 31
@expect screen Special moves within 10s
@wait 10t
@click slot 22
@expect screen /tune your/ within 5s
@click button "Make it!"
@expect chat /is in your Wish Bag now/ within 120s
@wait 1s
@assert execute if entity @e[tag=wishmob]
